            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f3" n="3" xml:id="d153-f3-content">
                <p> Volpe visited Poland for talks in November 1971. A memorandum of his November 3
                    conversation Jaroszewicz is in the Department of State, Polish Desk Files: Lot
                    74 D 440, Volpe Visit.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f4" n="4" xml:id="d153-f4-content">
                <p>There was no visit by U.S. astronauts to Poland in 1972.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
